Recoomendations for running on Server:

Download modpack for Curseforge.

Remove:
    appleskin-forge-mc1.19-2.4.2.jar
    CleanView-1.19.2-v1.jar
    EnchantmentDescriptions-Forge-1.19.2-13.0.20.jar
    entityculling-forge-1.6.1-mc1.19.2.jar
    Fallingleaves-1.19.1-2.0.0-alpha+20221129-2000.jar
    ToastControl-1.19.2-7.0.0.jar

Consider adding:
    https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-view

Included an example server.properties
